<reference id="kitControl-Minimum" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference ">
<title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-Minimum</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component determines the minimum value of valid inputs
and writes that value to out. <codeph class="+ topic/ph pr-d/codeph ">Out = min (inA, inB, inC, inD)</codeph>. </shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Minimum</indexterm></keywords></metadata>
</prolog>
<refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody ">
<section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">Minimum is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Math</uicontrol> folder of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette.</p></section>
</refbody>
</reference>